{hline 13}{c +}{hline 11}{hline 11}{hline 9}{hline 8}{hline 13}{hline 12}
{space 9}did {c |}{col 14}{res}{space 2}-1.933197{col 26}{space 2} .9966499{col 37}{space 1}   -1.94{col 46}{space 3}0.052{col 54}{space 4}-3.886633{col 67}{space 3} .0202397
{txt}{space 1}whether_pat {c |}{col 14}{res}{space 2}        0{col 26}{txt}  (omitted)
{space 7}_cons {c |}{col 14}{res}{space 2} 2004.517{col 26}{space 2} .0299543{col 37}{space 1} 6.7e+04{col 46}{space 3}0.000{col 54}{space 4} 2004.459{col 67}{space 3} 2004.576
